## Third-party assets are not covered by this licence

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository. It does
**not** grant rights to the following assets, which remain the property of
their respective owners and are included only so the demo renders:

- **Product and editorial photography** in `public/products/` and
  `public/editorial/` comes from the Shopify [mock.shop](https://mock.shop)
  demo catalogue. It depicts stoneware made by other studios and is not ours
  to license. Replace it with your own photography before any real use.
- **Reference screenshots** in `cook/refs/` are captures of
  fellowproducts.com, fermliving.com, italic.com and parachutehome.com, used
  for design study. They are excluded from version control.
- **Satoshi** (Indian Type Foundry / Fontshare) and **Instrument Serif**
  (Instrument / Google Fonts) are distributed under their own font licences.
  See the notes in `public/fonts/`.
- Product names, prices, copy and the LER brand are fictional and exist to
  demonstrate the storefront.
